{"word":"chitin","translation":"quitina","definition_en":"A tough, semitransparent, horny substance that is the principal component of the exoskeletons of arthropods (such as insects, crustaceans) and the cell walls of certain fungi.","definition_pt":"Uma substância dura, semitransparente, tesão que é o principal componente dos exoesqueletos de artrópodes (como insetos, crustáceos) e as paredes celulares de certos fungos.","example_en":"The hard outer shell of a beetle is primarily composed of chitin.","example_pt":"A dura casca externa de um besouro é composta principalmente de quitina.","cefr_level":"C1","word_type":"noun","category_slug":"science","frequency_rank":null},
